## Missing-Chemical Impact and Preparation

Native impact projection is pending. Do not buy more apple or pastry materials. Recover or recreate w/w receipts for Ethyl 2-Methylbutyrate 0.1%, Hexyl Acetate 10%, Cinnamaldehyde 1%, and Vanillin 10%, and verify EB, before physical dosing. All tinctures and procurement-pending Ambrettolide are excluded.

## Controlled Blinded Test Plan

Only after stock-basis verification, compare coded equal-mass, equal-concentration LH-04 and LH-01 samples in balanced order at 0, 5, and 30 minutes and 2 and 4 hours. Score L'Homme identity first, then apple clarity, pastry subordination, transitions, and liking. No physical result exists yet.

## Claim Ceiling

Physical liking, sensory similarity, stability, and measured headspace are `NOT TESTED`; safety and release are `NOT CLEARED`.

